[
  {
    "title": "拒绝内耗，做那个不合群的人",
    "url": "/posts/拒绝内耗/",
    "highlights": [
      {
        "text": "人生的本质意义是经历、体验、试错，而这些来自认知、野心、勇气和执行力。",
        "link": "/posts/拒绝内耗/#:~:text=%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%8F%E5%8E%86%E3%80%81%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E3%80%81%E8%AF%95%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%9B%E6%9D%A5%E8%87%AA%E8%AE%A4%E7%9F%A5%E3%80%81%E9%87%8E%E5%BF%83%E3%80%81%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E5%92%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82"
      },
      {
        "text": "把主要精力放在那个目标上，哪怕是难以企及的未来，只要前行，小步向前，也是不远的将来",
        "link": "/posts/拒绝内耗/#:~:text=%E6%8A%8A%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E7%B2%BE%E5%8A%9B%E6%94%BE%E5%9C%A8%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%AA%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%93%AA%E6%80%95%E6%98%AF%E9%9A%BE%E4%BB%A5%E4%BC%81%E5%8F%8A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%8F%E6%AD%A5%E5%90%91%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%9C%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%86%E6%9D%A5"
      },
      {
        "text": "围着圈子跑是忙碌，朝着目标前进才是高效",
        "link": "/posts/拒绝内耗/#:~:text=%E5%9B%B4%E7%9D%80%E5%9C%88%E5%AD%90%E8%B7%91%E6%98%AF%E5%BF%99%E7%A2%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%9D%E7%9D%80%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E5%89%8D%E8%BF%9B%E6%89%8D%E6%98%AF%E9%AB%98%E6%95%88"
      },
      {
        "text": "提高效率不是指做更多的事情，而是将你的全部精力集中在那些重要的事情上",
        "link": "/posts/拒绝内耗/#:~:text=%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%E5%81%9A%E6%9B%B4%E5%A4%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%83%85%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%B0%86%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E7%B2%BE%E5%8A%9B%E9%9B%86%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%A8%E9%82%A3%E4%BA%9B%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%83%85%E4%B8%8A"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "title": "向死而生：人生没有必修课",
    "url": "/posts/向死而生-人生没有必修课/",
    "highlights": [
      {
        "text": "人生没有必修课，唯有在死亡这一终极界限前，我们才被迫（或自愿）去定义属于自己的生命课程。",
        "link": "/posts/向死而生-人生没有必修课/#:~:text=%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE%E8%AF%BE%EF%BC%8C%E5%94%AF%E6%9C%89%E5%9C%A8%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%80%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E7%95%8C%E9%99%90%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%89%8D%E8%A2%AB%E8%BF%AB%EF%BC%88%E6%88%96%E8%87%AA%E6%84%BF%EF%BC%89%E5%8E%BB%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E3%80%82"
      },
      {
        "text": "\"你必死无疑；但此刻你还活着。在这段短暂的时间里，做合乎自然之事。\"",
        "link": "/posts/向死而生-人生没有必修课/#:~:text=%22%E4%BD%A0%E5%BF%85%E6%AD%BB%E6%97%A0%E7%96%91%EF%BC%9B%E4%BD%86%E6%AD%A4%E5%88%BB%E4%BD%A0%E8%BF%98%E6%B4%BB%E7%9D%80%E3%80%82%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%99%E6%AE%B5%E7%9F%AD%E6%9A%82%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E9%87%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%81%9A%E5%90%88%E4%B9%8E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%8B%E3%80%82%22"
      },
      {
        "text": "人生没有必须完成的 checklist，唯有顺应本性，逍遥游于天地之间，才是真正的自由",
        "link": "/posts/向死而生-人生没有必修课/#:~:text=%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%20checklist%EF%BC%8C%E5%94%AF%E6%9C%89%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%94%E6%9C%AC%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%8D%E9%81%A5%E6%B8%B8%E4%BA%8E%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E6%98%AF%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1"
      },
      {
        "text": "\"存在先于本质\"",
        "link": "/posts/向死而生-人生没有必修课/#:~:text=%22%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%88%E4%BA%8E%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%22"
      },
      {
        "text": "我们不再愿意把时间浪费在不喜欢的工作、无意义的人际关系、虚假的自我表现上",
        "link": "/posts/向死而生-人生没有必修课/#:~:text=%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E6%84%BF%E6%84%8F%E6%8A%8A%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E6%B5%AA%E8%B4%B9%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8D%E5%96%9C%E6%AC%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E3%80%81%E6%97%A0%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%89%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%85%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E3%80%81%E8%99%9A%E5%81%87%E7%9A%84%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E8%A1%A8%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%8A"
      },
      {
        "text": "既然终点已定，为何不冒险走一条少有人走的路？失败又如何？至少那是自己的选择",
        "link": "/posts/向死而生-人生没有必修课/#:~:text=%E6%97%A2%E7%84%B6%E7%BB%88%E7%82%B9%E5%B7%B2%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9%E8%B5%B0%E4%B8%80%E6%9D%A1%E5%B0%91%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E8%B5%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%AF%EF%BC%9F%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%E5%8F%88%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%EF%BC%9F%E8%87%B3%E5%B0%91%E9%82%A3%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9"
      },
      {
        "text": "\"美好的人生是一个过程，而不是一种状态；是一个方向，而不是一个目的地。\"",
        "link": "/posts/向死而生-人生没有必修课/#:~:text=%22%E7%BE%8E%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%EF%BC%9B%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E3%80%82%22"
      },
      {
        "text": "我想成为谁？我想如何度过这有限的时间？",
        "link": "/posts/向死而生-人生没有必修课/#:~:text=%E6%88%91%E6%83%B3%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E8%B0%81%EF%BC%9F%E6%88%91%E6%83%B3%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%BA%A6%E8%BF%87%E8%BF%99%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9F"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "title": "为什么我要自己造一个 RSS 阅读器",
    "url": "/posts/从零构建现代桌面RSS阅读器/",
    "highlights": [
      {
        "text": "这就是算法推荐的代价：你以为自己在获取信息，其实是信息在消费你。",
        "link": "/posts/从零构建现代桌面RSS阅读器/#:~:text=%E8%BF%99%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E4%BB%B7%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%A0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%9C%A8%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E5%AE%9E%E6%98%AF%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%9C%A8%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E4%BD%A0%E3%80%82"
      },
      {
        "text": "阅读的质量，比数量重要得多。",
        "link": "/posts/从零构建现代桌面RSS阅读器/#:~:text=%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%94%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E5%BE%97%E5%A4%9A%E3%80%82"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "title": "被过载的信息潮拿捏的有限人生",
    "url": "/posts/过载的信息潮/",
    "highlights": [
      {
        "text": "我们消耗的信息与我们摄入的食物一样重要。它影响着我们的思维，行为，以及我们如何理解自己在这个世界上的位置。",
        "link": "/posts/过载的信息潮/#:~:text=%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%91%84%E5%85%A5%E7%9A%84%E9%A3%9F%E7%89%A9%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E3%80%82%E5%AE%83%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E7%9D%80%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E7%9A%84%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%EF%BC%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E3%80%82"
      },
      {
        "text": "没有过程的结果真的好吗",
        "link": "/posts/过载的信息潮/#:~:text=%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E7%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%BD%E5%90%97"
      },
      {
        "text": "优质的内容越来越少，看起来就像信息沙漠在无边际的扩张蔓延",
        "link": "/posts/过载的信息潮/#:~:text=%E4%BC%98%E8%B4%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E8%B6%8A%E6%9D%A5%E8%B6%8A%E5%B0%91%EF%BC%8C%E7%9C%8B%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%E5%B0%B1%E5%83%8F%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%B2%99%E6%BC%A0%E5%9C%A8%E6%97%A0%E8%BE%B9%E9%99%85%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A9%E5%BC%A0%E8%94%93%E5%BB%B6"
      },
      {
        "text": "对学习目标的把握、对信息来源的挑选、对学习能力的提升。",
        "link": "/posts/过载的信息潮/#:~:text=%E5%AF%B9%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%8A%E6%8F%A1%E3%80%81%E5%AF%B9%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8C%91%E9%80%89%E3%80%81%E5%AF%B9%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E3%80%82"
      },
      {
        "text": "我们都缺少了学习者模式，即拥有一段不被打扰的闲置时间，用来进行思考，迸发灵感和想法",
        "link": "/posts/过载的信息潮/#:~:text=%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E9%83%BD%E7%BC%BA%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%86%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E8%80%85%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E6%8B%A5%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E6%AE%B5%E4%B8%8D%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%93%E6%89%B0%E7%9A%84%E9%97%B2%E7%BD%AE%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A5%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%B8%E5%8F%91%E7%81%B5%E6%84%9F%E5%92%8C%E6%83%B3%E6%B3%95"
      },
      {
        "text": "没有时间来学习的人，将会在未来成为「高危人群」",
        "link": "/posts/过载的信息潮/#:~:text=%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E6%9D%A5%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E3%80%8C%E9%AB%98%E5%8D%B1%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E3%80%8D"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "title": "内耗这个小鬼，我们该如何与之对抗",
    "url": "/posts/内耗是个小鬼/",
    "highlights": [
      {
        "text": "如果我们能心无杂念，把100%的能量花在奔跑上，就会迅速超过其他\"车辆\"。",
        "link": "/posts/内耗是个小鬼/#:~:text=%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E8%83%BD%E5%BF%83%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%82%E5%BF%B5%EF%BC%8C%E6%8A%8A100%25%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%A8%E5%A5%94%E8%B7%91%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E4%BC%9A%E8%BF%85%E9%80%9F%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%22%E8%BD%A6%E8%BE%86%22%E3%80%82"
      },
      {
        "text": "阻挡我们的不是眼前的困境，而是我们为自己设置的枷锁",
        "link": "/posts/内耗是个小鬼/#:~:text=%E9%98%BB%E6%8C%A1%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E7%9C%BC%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%B0%E5%A2%83%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E4%B8%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%9E%B7%E9%94%81"
      },
      {
        "text": "不必对未来过度忧虑，甩掉精神上的包袱，才能越走越快，越走越轻盈",
        "link": "/posts/内耗是个小鬼/#:~:text=%E4%B8%8D%E5%BF%85%E5%AF%B9%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E8%BF%87%E5%BA%A6%E5%BF%A7%E8%99%91%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A9%E6%8E%89%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%85%E8%A2%B1%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%B6%8A%E8%B5%B0%E8%B6%8A%E5%BF%AB%EF%BC%8C%E8%B6%8A%E8%B5%B0%E8%B6%8A%E8%BD%BB%E7%9B%88"
      },
      {
        "text": "只有通过不断的尝试和失败，我们才能真正地成长和进步",
        "link": "/posts/内耗是个小鬼/#:~:text=%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%8D%E6%96%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%9D%E8%AF%95%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%B0%E6%88%90%E9%95%BF%E5%92%8C%E8%BF%9B%E6%AD%A5"
      },
      {
        "text": "只有当我们学会独立思考和做出自己的选择时，我们才能真正地实现自我价值",
        "link": "/posts/内耗是个小鬼/#:~:text=%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E5%BD%93%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83%E5%92%8C%E5%81%9A%E5%87%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC"
